BEGIN:VCALENDAR
VERSION:2.0
PRODID:-//Littoralicious//Terroir Taormina//EN
X-WR-CALNAME:Taormina — eat & drink checklist
BEGIN:VTODO
UID:taormina-liste-1@littoralicious.com
SUMMARY:Granita di mandorla con brioche — Almond ice\, coarse-grained\, with a warm brioche.
DESCRIPTION:Say: gra-NEE-ta dee man-DOR-la. Taormina's queue\, and a serious granita. Best: Bam Bar\, Via di Giovanni
LOCATION:Bam Bar\, Via di Giovanni
URL:https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Bam+Bar+Taormina+Sicilia
END:VTODO
BEGIN:VTODO
UID:taormina-liste-2@littoralicious.com
SUMMARY:Etna Rosso di contrada — Nerello Mascalese bottled by its named lava parcel.
DESCRIPTION:Say: ET-na ROS-so. The mountain's red: high\, pale\, tannic. Best: A booked tasting at Graci\, Castiglione di Sicilia
LOCATION:A booked tasting at Graci\, Castiglione di Sicilia
URL:https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Graci+Castiglione+di+Sicilia+Sicilia
END:VTODO
BEGIN:VTODO
UID:taormina-liste-3@littoralicious.com
SUMMARY:A zero-additive Etna — Wine made with nothing added\, from the north slope.
DESCRIPTION:The reference for natural wine on the volcano\; strict visits\, adults only. Best: Frank Cornelissen\, Passopisciaro
LOCATION:Frank Cornelissen\, Passopisciaro
URL:https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Frank+Cornelissen+Castiglione+di+Sicilia+Sicilia
END:VTODO
BEGIN:VTODO
UID:taormina-liste-4@littoralicious.com
SUMMARY:Funghi dell'Etna — Mushrooms from the north slope's woods\, in autumn.
DESCRIPTION:Say: FOON-ghee. The mountain trattorie cook them in October. Best: Veneziano\, Randazzo
LOCATION:Veneziano\, Randazzo
URL:https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Veneziano+Randazzo+Sicilia
END:VTODO
BEGIN:VTODO
UID:taormina-liste-5@littoralicious.com
SUMMARY:Salumi from the butcher's counter — Cured meats and cheese at small tables facing the meat.
DESCRIPTION:Say: sa-LOO-mee. A butcher's shop turned restaurant. Best: In Cucina dai Pennisi\, Linguaglossa
LOCATION:In Cucina dai Pennisi\, Linguaglossa
URL:https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=In+Cucina+dai+Pennisi+Linguaglossa+Sicilia
END:VTODO
BEGIN:VTODO
UID:taormina-liste-6@littoralicious.com
SUMMARY:Vino alla mandorla — Sweet almond wine\, served cold.
DESCRIPTION:Say: VEE-no al-la MAN-dor-la. Castelmola's own drink\, at the café on the square above Taormina. Best: Antico Caffè San Giorgio\, Castelmola
LOCATION:Antico Caffè San Giorgio\, Castelmola
URL:https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Antico+Caff%C3%A8+San+Giorgio+Castelmola+Sicilia
END:VTODO
BEGIN:VTODO
UID:taormina-liste-7@littoralicious.com
SUMMARY:A gelato in Randazzo — Gelato from three sisters on Etna's north flank.
DESCRIPTION:Say: je-LA-to. Gambero Rosso's Gelateria of the Year in the 2027 guide. Best: Santo Musumeci\, Randazzo
LOCATION:Santo Musumeci\, Randazzo
URL:https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Pasticceria+Gelateria+Santo+Musumeci+Randazzo+Sicilia
END:VTODO
END:VCALENDAR
